␀␀␀␀.installed␀␀UPDATE OK - REBOOTING␀␀␀reboot to apply␀Web UI off␀␀Web UI: home WiFi name (SSID)␀␀␀Web UI: WiFi password (blank = open)␀␀␀␀rebooting to GTi.local␀␀Web UI on␀␀␀use WEB UI to set it up␀No home WiFi set␀␀␀␀checking...␀ match␀␀ matches␀␀␀␀[slow] settings action %u took %lums | int=%u psram=%u largest-int=%u
␀␀[nfo] open %s
